{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539000/extras/voicerecognition.png?t=1748614636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I switched on my<strong> microphone</strong>\u00a0and let the quiet settle in before asking the first question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cHow did you die?\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539000/extras/OuijaBoardGif-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1748614636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539000/extras/CamcorderExp.png?t=1748614636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u2019ve returned to the mansion after years, haunted by old memories. It\u2019s been shut down since the incident. I turn on my <strong>camcorder</strong> and step inside to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539000/extras/investigation.png?t=1748614636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u2019m determined to uncover every hidden detail, <strong>documenting</strong> the entire process for the world to witness in my <strong>camcorder</strong>.\u00a0 No bookcase, painting, or door will go unchecked\u2014every corner holds a <strong>secret</strong> waiting to be revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539000/extras/ExaminePainting.gif?t=1748614636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539000/extras/Use_your_microphone_to_uncover_hidden_secrets.__1_.png?t=1748614636\" />I searched around the house to find <strong>clues</strong> of my family's tragedy. I fou